# Per-validator node config — the repo ships *.example templates; each validator's
# live copy is seeded from them (see docker-compose.yml) and stays local, so edits
# (moniker, keys, gas price, Steem RPC) are never tracked, pushed, or block a pull.
# genesis.json and client.toml stay tracked — every validator must run them identically.
Instructions/app.toml
Instructions/config.toml

# Oracle secrets — the standalone bridge oracle reads ORACLE_PRIVATE_KEY /
# ORACLE_MNEMONIC from a local .env used by docker-compose. NEVER commit it.
.env

